              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{version}}/questions/{{questionId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}{{version}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "questions",
                "{{questionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sending `tags` replaces the whole set. Against the tags from Create Question, Express is dropped and PostgreSQL is added — check GET /tags?q=express and ?q=postgres afterwards to see questionCount move by one each way. Creating a brand-new tag needs 300 reputation, so stick to tags that already exist unless the logged-in user is over that."
          },
